          "settings": {
            "question": "What is perfume oil and does it last longer?",
            "answer": "Perfume oil is a concentrated, alcohol-free fragrance applied directly to the skin. Because it has no alcohol to evaporate, it typically lasts longer than a spray perfume, releasing slowly over many hours from a small amount."
