          "settings": {
            "question": "Is perfume oil better than spray perfume?",
            "answer": "Neither is simply better; they suit different needs. Perfume oil lasts longer, sits closer to the skin and is gentler on sensitive skin. Spray perfume projects more and is quicker to apply. Many people use oils for longevity and sprays for reach."
          }
        },
